<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-27T13:25:59.938Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 13:25:59 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes have intensified, killing at least 21 people and injuring 40 in Nyala and knocking out power in southeast Sudan, further hampering civilian life. Women under siege are increasingly serving as frontline responders while peace talks aim to end the drone war that fuels the humanitarian crisis. Hundreds of thousands of Sudanese refugees are now hosted in Chad as the regional humanitarian emergency expands. The conflict caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261027-chad-hosts-hundreds-of-thousands-of-sudanese-refugees-as-regional-humanitarian-crisis-extends&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/27/drone-strike-kills-at-least-21-and-injures-40-in-sudans-nyala?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/27/us-eu-and-30-countries-warn-of-famine-risk-in-sudan-call-for-aid?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168663&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168638&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQNFpfcVFSbjd3ZDV1YkotWjllNm1DekY4YnNtSzEzNGlZT0lDcHNXWVdUT1dvQTFSdDhXbnVIV1dWRTdXNnM1TkFkckUzZkFibzFmVnFYU0dMRG9DYTdNQkk5c2hGYWpDdWtIOUZhUDVFYXVrVzlmNWlQOU1mTFFoY0hJWEt5bmlybDhSbGNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPNHJaYUVqOFoyejRwVGc4ek9IUDJVdExRQnRhTnZpT3g0QzQzZHhBVFpxRmxFUjhmMlRnTWNsbnFzcVJsdkljeXFJd1g2QW5hSjNIRDZHcTJ0a1ZkYV9OaGdWTU5NaXhsUGFqQ1VOTEd2R1BKM1RTMmxENzJRRzN0ODhVUk1OS05YTjloMw?oc=5